    overview: "Finland is ranked the world's happiest country for seven consecutive years. A Nordic nation of 5.5 million people, extraordinary forests, and 188,000 lakes, Finland offers world-class education (the 'Finnish education miracle'), universal healthcare, exceptional digital public services, and a unique sauna culture. Helsinki is a sophisticated design city with a growing tech scene (home to Supercell, Nokia, and a thriving startup ecosystem).",
